stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> InReview : submit
  state InReview {
    [*] --> Technical
    Technical --> Quality : comments resolved
    Quality --> [*]
  }
  InReview --> Draft : changes requested
  InReview --> Effective : approved
  Effective --> Draft : new revision
  Effective --> Obsolete : withdrawn
  Obsolete --> [*]
  note right of Effective : Only one revision<br/>is effective at a time
